<title>USA: Tandy expected to post 5% Dec sales drop - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Tandy expected to post 5% Dec sales drop - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Though the results top most of its competitors, Tandy Corp is expected to report a five percent sales drop for December, The Wall Street Journal reported Thursday.</p>
<p>The drop represents sales at stores open at least a year, the story said.</p>
<p>Tandy's results are expected to be reported Thursday, the story said.</p>
